{{!
    @template tool_skills/profile_skill_summary

    Summary line of one skill in the Skills section of the user profile: the current level image, the
    skill name, the current level badge and the earned/total points. Used inside the accordion button of
    the detailed display and as the card header of the totals-only display of tool_skills/profile_skills.
    The pills are rendered outside the summary (tool_skills/profile_skill_pills), as they can be
    activated and must not sit inside the accordion button. Level colours are validated to a
    #rgb/#rrggbb hex on input, so it is safe to interpolate them into the inline style.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * name, hascurrentlevel, currentlevelname, hascurrentlevelcolor, currentlevelcolor, currentleveltextcolor
    * haslevelimage, levelimageurl
    * earned, hastotalpoints, pointstocomplete

    Example context (json):
    {
        "name": "My first skill",
        "hascurrentlevel": true,
        "currentlevelname": "Level 2",
        "hascurrentlevelcolor": true,
        "currentlevelcolor": "#22c55e",
        "currentleveltextcolor": "#000000",
        "haslevelimage": false,
        "levelimageurl": "",
        "earned": 10,
        "hastotalpoints": true,
        "pointstocomplete": 20
    }
}}
<span class="toolskill-summary d-flex align-items-start gap-2">
    {{#haslevelimage}}
    <img class="toolskill-level-img" src="{{levelimageurl}}" alt="{{currentlevelname}}">
    {{/haslevelimage}}
    <span class="toolskill-info">
        <span class="toolskill-name fw-bold">{{{name}}}</span>
        <span class="toolskill-meta d-flex align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2 mt-1">
            {{#hascurrentlevel}}
            <span class="badge rounded-pill toolskill-level-badge"
                {{#hascurrentlevelcolor}}style="background-color: {{currentlevelcolor}}; color: {{currentleveltextcolor}};"{{/hascurrentlevelcolor}}>{{{currentlevelname}}}</span>
            {{/hascurrentlevel}}
            <span class="toolskill-points"
                title="{{#str}}earned, tool_skills{{/str}}: {{earned}}{{#hastotalpoints}} / {{pointstocomplete}}{{/hastotalpoints}}">
                <span class="toolskill-earned fw-bold fs-5">{{earned}}</span>{{#hastotalpoints}}<span class="toolskill-total text-muted">/{{pointstocomplete}}</span>{{/hastotalpoints}}
            </span>
        </span>
    </span>
</span>
